  <History Date="17-05-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts (Rev 4.  Removes Red Shift and Dim Spd attributes.  Adds control attribute to 16 and 12 channel modes.  Revises mode names to reflect resulting channel counts)" Version="1" />
